  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay Sayori, the Redoubt should be just across this river.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596007
    - rid: 8164893304793596008
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You sure, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596010
    - rid: 8164893414404653191
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596012
    - rid: 8164893304793596013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Look:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596014
    - rid: 8164893304793596015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: As you can tell by the changes of elevation here on the map, and those
      big pillars up there-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596016
    - rid: 8164893304793596017
    - rid: 8164893304793596018
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: As well as the river in the way-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596019
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We're at the Redoubt.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596020
    - rid: 8164893304793596021
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay~!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596022
    - rid: 8164893304793596023
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How're we gonna get across the river, though?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596024
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's nothing stopping us from just jumping across those rocks-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596025
    - rid: 8164893304793596026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, that sounds like fun!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596027
    - rid: 8164893304793596028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Last one there's a rotten egg-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596029
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As Sayori runs her way toward the rocks, {mc} has a sudden flashback
      to an implanted memory where Sayori tripped and fell at a park, scraping her
      knee.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893304793596031
    - rid: 8164893304793596032
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Actually...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653159
    - rid: 8164893414404653160
    - rid: 8164893414404653197
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>WULD N4 KEST</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653161
    - rid: 8164893414404653162
    - rid: 8164893414404653163
    - rid: 8164893414404653164
    - rid: 8164893414404653189
    - rid: 8164893414404653190
    - rid: 8164893414404653196
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Deciding that it wasn't worth the risk of her getting all damp, {mc}
      uses the Whirlwind Sprint shout to pick up Sayori and make it over the river.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653166
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Eek!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653168
    - rid: 8164893414404653169
    - rid: 8164893414404653171
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What was that for, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653172
    - rid: 8164893414404653173
    - rid: 8164893414404653174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I know better than to trust <i>your</i> clumsy bum with a river crossing-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653175
    - rid: 8164893414404653176
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If this were the Oregon Trail, you'd definitely have gotten dysentery.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653178
    - rid: 8164893414404653192
    - rid: 8164893414404653195
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, the Oregon Trail? What's that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653179
    - rid: 8164893414404653198
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You... you don't know about the Oregon Trail?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653181
    - rid: 8164893414404653182
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure we covered it multiple times, even in elementary and
      middle school.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653183
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't remember that at all.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653184
    - rid: 8164893414404653185
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: And I remember all sorts of things from my early history classes!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653186
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: The Homeland had about 200 years of isolated peace before the Americans
      came a-knockin'!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653193
    - rid: 8164893414404653194
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The Homeland-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653199
    - rid: 8164893414404653200
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653201
    - rid: 8164893414404653202
    - rid: 8164893414404653203
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is something wrong, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653204
    - rid: 8164893414404653205
    - rid: 8164893414404653206
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You remember how I said that I don't belong with you guys?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653207
    - rid: 8164893414404653208
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653209
    - rid: 8164893414404653210
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'This is part of it: I''m...'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653211
    - rid: 8164893414404653212
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For lack of a better term, "written..."
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653213
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: To be an American.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653214
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Whereas the rest of you girls are "written" to be from some weird amalgamation
      of Japan and the state of California.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653215
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ooh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653216
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (American boy...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653217
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Isn't there a song that has a lyric like that?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653218
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's actually kinda cool!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653219
    - rid: 8164893414404653220
    - rid: 8164893414404653221
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653222
    - rid: 8164893414404653223
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653224
    - rid: 8164893414404653225
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That sort of explains how you knew how to make biscuits and gravy...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653226
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, you being American hasn't really made it hard for us to get
      along.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653227
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Your Japanese is really good!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653228
    - rid: 8164893414404653229
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (... I thought we were speaking and writing in English?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653230
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So yeah! You don't really have to worry about it, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653231
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We're all still your friends, even if you come from the United States.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653232
    - rid: 8164893414404653233
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653234
    - rid: 8164893414404653235
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We should get on our guard, there's definitely gonna be Forsworn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653236
    - rid: 8164893414404653237
    - rid: 8164893414404653238
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! Yeah! Right!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653239
    - rid: 8164893414404653240
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653241
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Perhaps on queue, the Forsworn make themselves known:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893414404653242
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Upon the ramparts, facing down toward the pair, is a few Forsworn archers
      who've already started drawing their bows.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466680
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm gonna rush 'em, sit tight, Sayori-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466681
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>wuld n4 kest</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466682
    - rid: 8164893420957466683
    - rid: 8164893420957466684
    - rid: 8164893420957466685
    - rid: 8164893420957466686
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As he charges into battle, {mc} accidently sets off a trip wire-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466687
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Watch out for the rocks-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466688
    - rid: 8164893420957466689
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With the last of the rocks evaded, Sayori looks toward where she last
      saw {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466719
    - rid: 8164893420957466720
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Using another burst of Whirlwind Sprint, he has managed to scale the
      battlements?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466721
    - rid: 8164893420957466722
    - rid: 8164893420957466723
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While up there, he unleashes the Unrelenting Force shout, flinging all
      three of the Forsworn archers off their perch.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466724
    - rid: 8164893420957466725
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: One of whom was flung right at Sayori-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466726
    - rid: 8164893420957466729
    - rid: 8164893420957466730
    - rid: 8164893420957466731
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8164893420957466727
    - rid: 8164893420957466728
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah... I had gotten used to fighting monsters-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386302268178538
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (It still feels a bit weird looking at a person's lifeless eyes...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386302268178539
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You good down there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386302268178540
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah! Yeah, I'm good!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386302268178541
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With confirmation that she's alright, {mc} makes his way deeper into
      the Redoubt.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089152
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089206
    - rid: 7219386325207089207
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>fus ro d4</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089208
    - rid: 7219386325207089209
    - rid: 7219386325207089210
    - rid: 7219386325207089211
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Two Forsworn splash into the water, having been shoved by {mc}'s Unrelenting
      Force shout.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089212
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They both fell in head first, stunning them briefly as they try to come
      to their senses-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089213
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: At which {mc} seizes the opportunity, driving his sword through one of
      their necks.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089215
    - rid: 7219386325207089216
    - rid: 7219386325207089217
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The other Forsworn attempts to swing their axe at {mc}-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089218
    - rid: 7219386325207089221
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: But he's able to hop back, dodging the slash.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089219
    - rid: 7219386325207089220
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Once he lands, he charges into the, now standing, Forsworn, piercing
      their chest and killing them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089222
    - rid: 7219386325207089223
    - rid: 7219386325207089224
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089225
    - rid: 7219386325207089227
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah? You doin' alright?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089228
    - rid: 7219386325207089229
    - rid: 7219386325207089230
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! Yeah, yeah, I'm good. It's just, uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089231
    - rid: 7219386325207089232
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm a little uncomfortable with all the... killing...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089235
    - rid: 7219386325207089237
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? You didn't really seem to mind it back in the Barrow.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089238
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's different! All the draugr were <i>already</i> dead...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089239
    - rid: 7219386325207089240
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Didn't you "finish" the College of Winterhold questline with Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089241
    - rid: 7219386325207089242
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089243
    - rid: 7219386325207089244
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That would mean you've at least killed Ancano and the other guy, what
      makes <i>them</i> different?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089245
    - rid: 7219386325207089246
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: They were evil and trying to end the world!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089247
    - rid: 7219386325207089248
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, Yuri was the one who killed Ancano, and I only killed the other
      guy on accident...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089249
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (On accident...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089250
    - rid: 7219386325207089251
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, in that case, these guys ambushed some innocent courier and stole
      something that didn't belong to them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089252
    - rid: 7219386325207089253
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's why we're here, remember?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089254
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, I know, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089257
    - rid: 7219386325207089259
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>You've been kind of, uh, killing everyone without any sign of
      remorse...</Speed>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089260
    - rid: 7219386325207089261
    - rid: 7219386325207089262
    - rid: 7219386325207089263
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, duh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089264
    - rid: 7219386325207089265
    - rid: 7219386325207089267
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, they're just a bunch of hostile NPCs, nothing to worry about-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089266
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Grk-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089273
    - rid: 7219386325207089274
    - rid: 7219386325207089276
    - rid: 7219386325207089278
    - rid: 7219386325207089279
    - rid: 7219386325207089280
    - rid: 7219386325207089281
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While they were talking, an arrow made its way to {mc}'s shoulder!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (If that's how you want to play it, fine!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089284
    - rid: 7219386325207089285
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} runs toward the small cliff face on the left, to get some cover
      from the archer who shot down from above-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089286
    - rid: 7219386325207089287
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>Strun</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089288
    - rid: 7219386325207089289
    - rid: 7219386325207089290
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what the-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089293
    - rid: 7219386325207089294
    - rid: 7219386325207089296
    - rid: 7219386325207089297
    - rid: 7219386325207089298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori- get over here!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089299
    - rid: 7219386325207089300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, okay-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089303
    - rid: 7219386325207089304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Eek-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089305
    - rid: 7219386325207089306
    - rid: 7219386325207089308
    - rid: 7219386325207089309
    - rid: 6136300751623028788
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=1,1>{mc}, did you make this lightning storm</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089310
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah- you mind helping me with this arrow in my shoulder?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089311
    - rid: 7219386325207089312
    - rid: 7219386325207089313
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It hurts like crap and I can't feel my hand.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 7219386325207089314
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, uh, right...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028789
    - rid: 6136300751623028790
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Shouldn't we, uh, take it out first?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028791
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, I'll count down from three and then we'll pull it out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028792
    - rid: 6136300751623028793
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: While the two of them are talking, the stealthy Forsworn archer that
      shot {mc} has been making their way toward them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They draw back their bow, and...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028794
    - rid: 6136300751623028795
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Gah-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028796
    - rid: 6136300751623028797
    - rid: 6136300751623028798
    - rid: 6136300751623028799
    - rid: 6136300751623028800
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That lightning bolt almost hit us!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028801
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The stealthy Forsworn archer's arrow-pulling arm has been made lame by
      a direct lightning strike.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but we're fine. The lightning won't hit us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028802
    - rid: 6136300751623028803
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, on pull-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028804
    - rid: 6136300751623028805
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>3, 2, 1</Speed>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028806
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pu<NoiseText=3,1>uuUUL- Ah FUCK</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028807
    - rid: 6136300751623028808
    - rid: 6136300751623028812
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, are you okay-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028809
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>NO! Heal me, please</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028810
    - rid: 6136300751623028811
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That was a stupid question, wasn't it? Ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028813
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: -!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028814
    - rid: 6136300751623028815
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Feelin' better?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028816
    - rid: 6136300751623028817
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh... Yeah, still a bit sore, though.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028818
    - rid: 6136300751623028819
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon, let's get moving.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028820
    - rid: 6136300751623028821
    - rid: 6136300751623028822
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028823
    - rid: 6136300751623028824
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The pair encounter an approaching group of four Forsworn-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028825
    - rid: 6136300751623028826
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, nevermind. They actually encounter a group of three Forsworn.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028827
    - rid: 6136300751623028828
    - rid: 6136300751623028829
    - rid: 6136300751623028834
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The massive lightning strike directly hitting one of their comrades distracts
      the enemy party-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028830
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Which {mc} takes as an opportunity to joust the nearest one.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028831
    - rid: 6136300751623028832
    - rid: 6136300751623028833
    - rid: 6136300751623028835
    - rid: 6136300751623028836
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With half of their motly crew taken down in but a few seconds, the other
      two scramble to strike at {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The one closest to {mc} raises their blade to slash at him-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: But gets flung away by an Unrelenting Force shout.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028837
    - rid: 6136300751623028838
    - rid: 6136300751623028839
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The remaining one throws a fireball at {mc}, but in their haste curves
      their attack in such a way it can be easily dodged.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: They are unable to launch another attack before {mc} closes the distance,
      slashing directly into their chest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028841
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With three out of four confirmed dead, {mc} looks toward the Forsworn
      he previously flung.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028842
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 77b2d632048fc8c4ca1a2060656b315b, type: 2}
    dialog: N-no, I'm beaten, please have merc-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The Forsworn's pleas are cut short.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028843
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} does one final cursory scan of the area, finding no other immediate
      threats.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028844
    - rid: 6136300751623028845
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028846
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, w-why did you kill that guy?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028847
    - rid: 6136300751623028848
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: He said you won, you didn't need to kill him!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028849
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Meh, they <i>all</i> say that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028850
    - rid: 6136300751623028851
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, I know for a fact that all NPCs don't actually lose aggro if
      you knock them down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028852
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Except when you're "Brawling" but that's not what this was-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028853
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028854
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay wow, this is really affecting you, huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028855
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Didn't I say something along the lines that killing is an inevitablility
      when we first arrived here?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028856
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028857
    - rid: 6136300751623028858
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're kind of scary right now, {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028859
    - rid: 6136300751623028860
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028861
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Oh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028862
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, I know it seems a bit bad that I can just tear through people like
      this-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028863
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: A bit?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028864
    - rid: 6136300751623028865
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But, as I've said before, these people are not real.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028866
    - rid: 6136300751623028867
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Their suffering is not real-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028868
    - rid: 6136300751623028870
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Neither are we, dang it!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028869
    - rid: 6136300751623028871
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: If you get a free pass to be mean just because something isn't real-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Then that means that the entity guy or whoever should just be able to
      do whatever they want with us!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028873
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028874
    - rid: 6136300751623028875
    - rid: 6136300751623028876
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028877
    - rid: 6136300751623028878
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028879
    - rid: 6136300751623028880
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why are you walking away?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028881
    - rid: 6136300751623028882
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because I just want to be done with this, dang it!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028883
    - rid: 6136300751623028884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Believe it or not, I don't actually <i>like</i> killing people.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028885
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Being stuck here has without a doubt been the worst experience of my
      "life!"
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I was able to push through it for a bit, under the false hope that my
      efforts would be rewarded with a return home.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028886
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But no! I'm stuck here, stuck with the powers of a demigod!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028887
    - rid: 6136300751623028888
    - rid: 6136300751623028889
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ha! Isn't it ironic?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028890
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For my age, the most powerful being on this plane of existence-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But I don't have any <i>real</i> power.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028891
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because <i>NOTHING</i> is <i>REAL</i>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028892
    - rid: 6136300751623028893
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028894
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, I'm just trying to get back to Natsuki in one piece as soon as
      possible.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028895
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The quickest and safest way to do that is to use everything at my disposal.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028896
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It just so happens that my arsenal is very good at killing people.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028897
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you've got problems with the moral efficacy of my methodology-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You should take it up with Bethesda Game Studios for making their worlds
      hinge primarily on violence.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028898
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You really should know by now how "dog eat dog" this world is.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028899
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028900
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon. The sooner we're done here, the sooner we get back to civilization.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028901
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028902
    - rid: 6136300751623028903
    - rid: 6136300751623028904
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The pair have reached the apex of the Redoubt:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Dead ahead, a massive waterfall, to their left a word wall and an altar...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: On the stone path to the altar lies a dead Forsworn, the large burn mark
      implying the cause of death was a lightning strike.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The package or whatever is probably in the boss loot chest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028905
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Boss loot chest, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028906
    - rid: 6136300751623028907
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, that big chest right there by the word wall.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028908
    - rid: 6136300751623028909
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: At the end of every dungeon, and a lot of named locations, there's a
      big chest of loot- the boss chest.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's probably a Briarheart guarding this one-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028910
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! Unless it's a Hagraven- it <i>might</i> be a Hagraven.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300751623028911
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205109
    - rid: 6136300765852205110
    - rid: 6136300765852205111
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: It seems {mc} was correct; a Hagraven stands before the altar.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205112
    - rid: 6136300765852205113
    - rid: 6136300765852205114
    - rid: 6136300765852205115
    - rid: 6136300765852205116
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (... ew...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205117
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: 'A raspy voice croaks from the Hagraven''s mouth:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ce592150a2a4ee48b7115dba73fa8c2, type: 2}
    dialog: Quite the impressive storm you've cooked up, boy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205118
    - rid: 6136300765852205119
    - rid: 6136300765852205120
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ce592150a2a4ee48b7115dba73fa8c2, type: 2}
    dialog: If I didn't know any better, I'd say that those lightning bolts had minds
      of their own-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: A bolt of lightning comes down, which the Hagraven catches- presumably
      with some sort of ward.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205121
    - rid: 6136300765852205122
    - rid: 6136300765852205123
    - rid: 6136300765852205124
    - rid: 6136300765852205125
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... and who said I could change the weather?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205126
    - rid: 6136300765852205127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ce592150a2a4ee48b7115dba73fa8c2, type: 2}
    dialog: No point in denying it, you said it to that girl not a few minutes ago.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205128
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay, since when was supernatural hearing a thing Hagravens could do?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205129
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ce592150a2a4ee48b7115dba73fa8c2, type: 2}
    dialog: Perhaps I'll learn the secrets to your form of weather manipulation after
      I'm done dissecting you-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205132
    - rid: 6136300765852205133
    - rid: 6136300765852205134
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: At this, {mc} raises his sword for the fight at hand.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300765852205135
    - rid: 6136300765852205136
    - rid: 6136300765852205137
    - rid: 6136300765852205138
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055554
    - rid: 6136300878837055555
    - rid: 6136300878837055556
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ce592150a2a4ee48b7115dba73fa8c2, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=3,1>...</NoiseText>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055557
    - rid: 6136300878837055558
    - rid: 6136300878837055559
    - rid: 6136300878837055560
    - rid: 6136300878837055561
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: In a fit of desperation, the Hagraven attempts to channel as much magicka
      as she can-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055603
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The chest behind her started glowing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055562
    - rid: 6136300878837055563
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The glow of the chest starts flowing into the Hagraven and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055564
    - rid: 6136300878837055565
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055566
    - rid: 6136300878837055567
    - rid: 6136300878837055568
    - rid: 6136300878837055569
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055570
    - rid: 6136300878837055571
    - rid: 6136300878837055572
    - rid: 6136300878837055576
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Did...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055573
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Did that ever-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055574
    - rid: 6136300878837055575
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: In fact, based on how that... <i>looked</i>, I'd say that's definitely
      <b>not</b> supposed to happen.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ever.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055577
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Phew...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055578
    - rid: 6136300878837055579
    - rid: 6136300878837055582
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <font=dragonfont>lok v4 k8r</font>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055583
    - rid: 6136300878837055584
    - rid: 6136300878837055585
    - rid: 6136300878837055586
    - rid: 6136300878837055620
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The storm {mc} summoned parts, revealing midday's sky.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055587
    - rid: 6136300878837055588
    - rid: 6136300878837055589
    - rid: 6136300878837055621
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's... let's go see what's in that chest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Y-yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300878837055591
    - rid: 6136300878837055592
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=1>{mc} grabs the lid and lifts it open...</Speed>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451264
    - rid: 6136300905229451265
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451266
    - rid: 6136300905229451267
    - rid: 6136300905229451268
    - rid: 6136300905229451270
    - rid: 6136300905229451271
    - rid: 6136300905229451272
    - rid: 6136300905229451273
    - rid: 6136300905229451274
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} closes the lid.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451323
    - rid: 6136300905229451324
    - rid: 6136300905229451325
    - rid: 6136300905229451326
    - rid: 6136300905229451327
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... uh, what <i>was</i> that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451328
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I- I'm not entirely sure...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451329
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} opens the chest again, revealing the strange object inside.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451330
    - rid: 6136300905229451331
    - rid: 6136300905229451332
    - rid: 6136300905229451333
    - rid: 6136300905229451334
    - rid: 6136300905229451335
    - rid: 6136300905229451336
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It, well... it's definitely beating...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451337
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} reaches into the chest to touch it-'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451338
    - rid: 6136300905229451339
    - rid: 6136300905229451340
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ack-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451341
    - rid: 6136300905229451342
    - rid: 6136300905229451343
    - rid: 6136300905229451344
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That thing's scalding!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, whatever it is, we're not going to be able to carry it out of here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451345
    - rid: 6136300905229451346
    - rid: 6136300905229451347
    - rid: 6136300905229451349
    - rid: 6136300905229451351
    - rid: 6136300905229451352
    - rid: 6136300905229451353
    - rid: 6136300905229451354
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We need to head back to let Natsuki know we'll need a cart or something-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451355
    - rid: 6136300905229451356
    - rid: 6136300905229451357
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Also, thanks for healing my hand.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451358
    - rid: 6136300905229451359
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No problem!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 6136300905229451360
    - rid: 6136300905229451361
